msgstr "LV1/LV2"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4547
msgid "Conceal LADSPA (LV1) Plugins if matching LV2 exists"
msgstr "Ocultar plugins LADSPA (LV1) si existe un plugin LV2 correspondiente"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4551
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "Instrumento"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4555
msgid "Ask to replace existing instrument plugin"
msgstr "Preguntar para reemplazar plugin de instrumento existente"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4563
msgid "Interactively configure instrument plugins on insert"
msgstr ""
"Configurar los plugins de instrumentos de forma interactiva al insertarlo"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4569
msgid ""
"<b>When enabled</b> show a dialog to select instrument channel configuration "
"before adding a multichannel plugin."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cuando está habilitado</b> se mostrará un diálogo para seleccionar la "
"configuración del canal de instrumento antes de añadir un plugin multicanal."

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4571
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Estadísticas"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4574
msgid "Reset Statistics"
msgstr "Reiniciar estadísticas"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4580
msgid "Plugin chart (use-count) length"
msgstr "Longitud de la lista de plugins más usados"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4589
msgid "Plugin recent list length"
msgstr "Longitud de la lista de plugins recientes"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4603
msgid "Record monitoring handled by"
msgstr "Monitorización de la grabación manejado por"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4620
msgid "Auto Input does 'talkback'"
msgstr "Entrada automática hace 'talkback'"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4626
msgid ""
"<b>When enabled</b>, and Transport -> Auto-Input is enabled, %1 will always "
"monitor audio inputs when transport is stopped, even if tracks aren't armed."
msgstr "<b>Activado:</b> si Transporte -> Entrada automática está activo, %1 monitoriza siempre las entradas de audio con el transporte parado, aunque las pistas no estén armadas."

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4633
msgid "Solo controls are Listen controls"
msgstr "Los controles de solo son controles de escucha"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4643
msgid "Exclusive solo"
msgstr "Solo exclusivo"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4651
msgid "Show solo muting"
msgstr "Mostrar mudos de solo"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4659
msgid "Soloing overrides muting"
msgstr "Solo invalida mudo"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4667
msgid "Solo-in-place mute cut (dB)"
msgstr "Corte de solo / mudo (dB)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4674
msgid "Listen Position"
msgstr "Posición de escucha"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4679
msgid "after-fader (AFL)"
msgstr "Post-fader (AFL) "

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4680
msgid "pre-fader (PFL)"
msgstr "pre-fader (PFL)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4686
msgid "PFL signals come from"
msgstr "Las señales PFL vienen desde"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4691
msgid "before pre-fader processors"
msgstr "antes de procesadores pre-fader"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4692
msgid "pre-fader but after pre-fader processors"
msgstr "pre-fader pero después de procesadores pre-fader"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4698
msgid "AFL signals come from"
msgstr "Las señales AFL vienen desde"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4703
msgid "immediately post-fader"
msgstr "inmediatamente post-fader"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4704
msgid "after post-fader processors (before pan)"
msgstr "después de procesadores post-fader (antes de pan)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4710
msgid "Master"
msgstr "Máster"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4714
msgid "Enable master-bus output gain control"
msgstr "Activar el control de ganancia de salida del bus máster"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4721
msgid "I/O Resampler (vari-speed) quality"
msgstr "Calidad del remuestreador de E/S (velocidad variable)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4726
msgid "Off (no vari-speed)"
msgstr "Desactivado (sin velocidad variable)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4727
msgid "Low (16 samples latency)"
msgstr "Baja (16 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4728
msgid "Moderate (32 samples latency), default"
msgstr "Moderada (32 muestras de latencia), predeterminada"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4729
msgid "Medium (64 samples latency)"
msgstr "Media (64 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4730
msgid "High (96 samples latency)"
msgstr "Alta (96 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4731
msgid "Very High (128 samples latency)"
msgstr "Muy alta (128 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4732
msgid "Extreme (184 samples latency)"
msgstr "Extrema (184 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4744
msgid "Custom (%1 samples latency)"
msgstr "Personalizada (%1 muestras de latencia)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4747
msgid "This setting will only take effect when the Audio Engine is restarted."
msgstr "Este ajuste se aplica al reiniciar el motor de audio."

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4748
msgid ""
"To facilitate vari-speed playback/recording, audio is resampled to change "
"pitch and speed. This introduces latency depending on the quality. For "
"consistency this latency is also present when not vari-speeding (even if no "
"resampling happens).\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to disable this feature, which will also disable vari-speed. "
"- Except if the audio-engine runs at a different sample-rate than the "
"session, the quality is set to be at least 'Very High' (128 samples round-"
"trip latency)"
msgstr "Para permitir la reproducción y grabación a velocidad variable, el audio se remuestrea para cambiar tono y velocidad. Esto añade una latencia que depende de la calidad. Por coherencia, esa latencia está también cuando no se usa la velocidad variable (aunque no haya remuestreo).\n\nSe puede desactivar, lo que también desactiva la velocidad variable. Excepto si el motor de audio funciona a una frecuencia distinta a la de la sesión: entonces la calidad es al menos 'Muy alta' (128 muestras de latencia de ida y vuelta)"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4752
msgid "Default Track / Bus Muting Options"
msgstr "Opciones predeterminadas de silencio de pista/bus"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4757
msgid "Mute affects pre-fader sends"
msgstr "Mudo afecta envíos pre-fader"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4765
msgid "Mute affects post-fader sends"
msgstr "Mudo afecta envíos post-fader"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4773
msgid "Mute affects control outputs"
msgstr "Mudo afecta a salidas de control"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4781
msgid "Mute affects main outputs"
msgstr "Mudo afecta a salidas principales"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4787
msgid "Send Routing"
msgstr "Ruteado de envíos"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4791
msgid "Link panners of Aux and External Sends with main panner by default"
msgstr ""
"Enlazar panorámicas de envíos auxiliares y externos con el panorámico "
"principal de forma predeterminada"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4796
msgid "Audio Regions"
msgstr "Regiones de audio"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4801
msgid "Replicate missing region channels"
msgstr "Duplicar canales de región ausentes"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4807
msgid "Track and Bus Connections"
msgstr "Conexiones de Pista y Bus"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4811
msgid "Auto-connect main output (master or monitor) bus to physical ports"
msgstr ""
"Conectar automáticamente el bus de salida principal (principal o monitor) a "
"los puertos físicos"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4817
msgid ""
"<b>When enabled</b> the main output bus is auto-connected to the first N "
"physical ports. If the session has a monitor-section, the monitor-bus output "
"is connected to the hardware playback ports, otherwise the master-bus output "
"is directly used for playback."
msgstr ""
"<b>Cuando está habilitado</b>, el bus de salida principal se conecta "
"automáticamente a los primeros N puertos físicos. Si la sesión tiene una "
"sección de monitor, la salida del bus de monitor se conecta a los puertos de "
"reproducción de hardware, de lo contrario, la salida del bus maestro se "
"utiliza directamente para la reproducción."

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4823
msgid "Connect track inputs"
msgstr "Conectar a entradas de pista"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4828
msgid "automatically to physical inputs"
msgstr "automáticamente a entradas físicas"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4829 rc_option_editor.cc:4844
msgid "manually"
msgstr "manualmente"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4837
msgid "Connect track and bus outputs"
msgstr "Conectar salidas de pista y bus"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4842
msgid "automatically to physical outputs"
msgstr "automáticamente a salidas físicas"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4843
msgid "automatically to master bus"
msgstr "automáticamente al bus master"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4850
msgid "Use 'Strict-I/O' for new tracks or busses"
msgstr "Usar 'E/S Estrictas' para nuevas pistas o buses"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4861
msgid "Hardware Patchbay"
msgstr "Conexiones de hardware"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4865
msgid "Restore hardware to hardware connections"
msgstr "Restaurar las conexiones entre hardware"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4872
msgid ""
"When enabled, external per session hardware to hardware connections are "
"restored on session load. This applies to internal backends (ALSA, Portaudio/"
"ASIO, CoreAudio) only."
msgstr "Activado: al cargar una sesión se restauran sus conexiones entre hardware. Solo con los motores internos (ALSA, PortAudio/ASIO, CoreAudio)."

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4884
msgid "Allow non quarter-note pulse"
msgstr "Permitir pulso que no sea de nota negra"

#: rc_option_editor.cc:4889
msgid ""
"<b>When enabled</b> %1 will allow tempo to be expressed in divisions per "
"minute\n"
